                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "But for the extremely annoying minigames, I would definitely recommend this Match 3 game. If you're just playing to enjoy gem blasting, then I would say go for it, but if you're going for a 100% achievement score, you might want to reconsider, otherwise you're in for a tough challenge, especially with January's \"snowflake\" minigame which requires nearly impossible quickness, perfect reflexes, and 100% accuracy. If you miss that achievement, you can forget about a perfect score. You can replay any minigame, however, I probably tried that one minigame 2 dozen times and I could not nail it, so I gave up trying. \n\nThe Match levels no problem; the hidden object games between levels, no problem; MOST of the mini-games (although annoying) no problem, but that one annoying-ass \"Snowflake\" game was impossible for me to beat. It pissed me off. And, just because they stuck that irritating AF minigame into this game, I am not recommending Season Match 2 for achievement hunters and completionists.",
